    "title" "Spectate Mate"
    "description" "Right-click a teammate's avatar during combat to watch them play, in real time.<br><br>While spectating you see THEIR: hand (real card visuals and animations), energy, stars, relics, potions, draw/discard/exhaust piles, card selection, and hover highlight.<br><br>Read-only and client-side only: nothing you do while spectating can affect their game, and no data is sent over the network.<br><br>Press Esc (rebindable) to return to your own view. Spectating ends automatically when combat ends.<br><br>Requires RitsuLib."
    "changenote" "Initial release"
